### Variables (VS Code REST Client / Rider / VS 2022 .http)
@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = sk_finocore_CHANGE_ME_1a2b3c4d5e6f
@deviceKey = dk_phone1_CHANGE_ME_a1b2c3d4e5f6
@adminKey = CHANGE-ME-admin-key-9f8e7d6c

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### ---------- CLIENT ----------

### Send OTP
POST {{host}}/api/sms/send
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "9876543210", "message": "Your OTP is 4821", "priority": 10, "reference": "otp-4821" }

### Send via GET URL (key in query string)
GET {{host}}/api/sms/send?apiKey={{apiKey}}&to=9876543210&message=Your+OTP+is+4821&priority=10&reference=otp-4821

### Status via GET URL
GET {{host}}/api/sms/status?apiKey={{apiKey}}&reference=otp-4821

### Send bulk
POST {{host}}/api/sms/send-bulk
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [
  { "to": "9876543210", "message": "EMI due tomorrow" },
  { "to": "9123456789", "message": "Payment received, thank you", "reference": "pay-1001" }
] }

### Status by reference
GET {{host}}/api/sms/by-reference/otp-4821
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### My messages (failed only)
GET {{host}}/api/sms?status=Failed&page=1&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Stats today
GET {{host}}/api/sms/stats
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ---------- DEVICE (what the Android app does) ----------

### Heartbeat
POST {{host}}/api/device/heartbeat
X-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "batteryLevel": 80, "appVersion": "1.0.0", "simInfo": "Jio" }

### Claim messages
GET {{host}}/api/device/messages?max=5
X-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}

### Report status
POST {{host}}/api/device/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
X-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Sent" }

### ---------- ADMIN ----------

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Create phone (device key returned once)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/devices
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Phone-2", "phoneNumber": "+919999999999", "maxPerMinute": 10, "dailyLimit": 300 }

### Create API client (key returned once)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/clients
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Finocore Production" }

### All messages
GET {{host}}/api/admin/messages?pageSize=50
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Retry a failed message
POST {{host}}/api/admin/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
